  "notes": "FORMS:\n{微笑|びしょう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - to smile gently\n\nALTERNATE READING:\n{微笑|ほほえ}み - also means smile (kun'yomi reading, more common in everyday speech)\n{微笑|ほほえ}む - to smile (verb)\n\nUSAGE:\n{微笑|びしょう} is a refined, literary word. In everyday conversation, ⟦{笑顔|えがお}→笑顔：01884_egao⟧ (smiling face) or ほほえみ is more common.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {微笑|びしょう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{浮|う}かべる→浮かべる：13314_ukaberu⟧ - to show a smile\n- {優|やさ}しい{微笑|びしょう} - gentle smile\n- ⟦{謎|なぞ}→謎：03505_nazo⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{微笑|びしょう} - mysterious smile",
